  "title": "Spicy Chipotle Grilled Shrimp",
  "description": "Marinated shrimp, grilled on skewers, have the fiery flavors of chipotle chilies, garlic, and red pepper flakes. This is for those who like their grilled shrimp spicy enough to break a sweat.",
